data: {"id": "ffdee318dfd640aa-thinking-parallel_evidence-2285", "run_id": "ffdee318dfd640aa", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "我已收到所有首轮工具的原始返回。现在开始逐项分析证据，识别支持、反驳和缺失部分。\n\n---\n\n## 已采集事实\n\n### 1. Pod 身份与生命周期（kubectl_get_yaml + kubectl_describe）\n\n- **Pod 名称**: `workload`\n- **命名空间**: `aiops-case-11`\n- **Pod UID**: `00030ff2-85db-453a-808d-4293aba8f20c`\n- **节点**: `node2` (10.2.0.50)\n- **容器**: `app` (image: `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`)\n- **创建时间**: 2026-09-03T22:30:59Z\n- **deletionTimestamp**: 2026-09-03T22:31:03Z\n- **terminationGracePeriodSeconds**: 10\n- **deletionGracePeriodSeconds**: 0（spec 中为 0，但 des", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788479424109, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

